  {
    "id": 2018010110030,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふゆ、今日は改めて話したいことがあって",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close6",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "089",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801011/2018010110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018010110040,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "──……先週お便りをくれた、\r\nラジオネームゆゆちゃんさん",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801011/2018010110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018010110050,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ゆゆちゃんさんへの答え、\r\nもう少し補足させてください",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801011/2018010110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018010110060,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "もし、ゆゆちゃんさんと同じ悩みを抱えている人がいたら\r\nそんなあなたも聞いててね",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801011/2018010110060"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 2018010110070,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "先週、ふゆは『ゆゆちゃんさんのままでいてね』\r\nって言いました",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801011/2018010110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018010110080,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "その言葉に嘘はないの\r\n──だって、自分じゃない自分になるのは大変だと思うから",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801011/2018010110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018010110090,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ゆゆちゃんさんが、\r\nゆゆちゃんさんのままで愛されないのは──……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_bitter_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801011/2018010110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018010110100,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "きっと、ゆゆちゃんさんにとって\r\n悲しいことだと思うから",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801011/2018010110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018010110110,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "だから、ふゆは──……\r\nあなたを残したままでいてほしいって思いました",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801011/2018010110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018010110120,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "────でも",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801011/2018010110120"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2018010110130,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "それじゃあ太刀打ちできないって\r\n思うこともあるかもしれない。そうしたら──……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801011/2018010110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018010110140,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "頑張って頑張って、理想のあなたを作り上げてください",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801011/2018010110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018010110150,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "それがふゆだって言ってくれるなら、それもいいよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801011/2018010110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018010110160,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふゆのことすごく見て、どこがいいなって思うのか考えて、\r\n真似して、直して、また真似して──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801011/2018010110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018010110170,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "──いつか本物になるまで",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801011/2018010110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018010110180,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "そういう気持ちで頑張るのも──……\r\nアリだなって、ふゆは思います",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801011/2018010110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018010110190,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……ごめんね\r\nこの答えを、先週言えたらよかったんだけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_bitter_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801011/2018010110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018010110200,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ちゃんと考えないと……\r\nふゆも、自分の気持ちがわからなくて",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801011/2018010110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018010110210,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "遅くなっちゃってごめんなさい\r\n──今のを、ふゆからの回答にできたらと思います",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801011/2018010110210"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
